; orchard_windy_gap.room - O Vao do Vento (design 04 section 3.6); entered from the mill town's lowered drawbridge onto the east ledge (cols 36-38).
; Outono Espacial 2 (design 02 section 8): a 20-cell chasm with a westward current; double jump 13.6, with the current 19.6, with the gale
; 18.8 cells; the gale played on the ledge into the current carries about 21.7. Logico 2: Soltar drops the cocoon on the shelf, a westward gale
; blows it onto the plate at col 4, and the plate holds the gate at col 12 open to the alcove under the shelf. A fall drops into the mill town.

